            "arguments": "{\"userQuestion\":\"weather history in London, Ohio\"}",
            "output": "Here is some weather history for London, Ohio:\n\n1. Event: Flood\n   - Start: 3/1/2007 11:30 PM\n   - End: 3/2/2007 1:30 AM\n   - Property Damage: $3000\n   - Crop Damage: $0\n   - Event Narrative: Several roads were flooded and closed. A few creeks rose out of their banks across the county.\n   - Episode Narrative: A cold front swept across southern and western Ohio during the evening, producing locally heavy rainfall.\n\n2. Event: Flood\n   - Start: 3/14/2007 6:45 AM\n   - End: 3/14/2007 9:30 AM\n   - Property Damage: $3000\n   - Crop Damage: $0\n   - Event Narrative: Several roads were flooded across the county.\n   - Episode Narrative: Heavy rain fell across west central and central Ohio and the Miami Valley ahead of a cold front.\n\nLet me know if you'd like more details or more recent weather events!\n",
