                "text": "Weather event history on record for **London, Ohio** includes:\n\n- **Flood** — **Mar 1, 2007 (11:30 PM) to Mar 2, 2007 (1:30 AM)**  \n  **Damage:** ~$3,000 property; $0 crop  \n  **Details:** Several roads were flooded and closed; a few creeks rose out of their banks.  \n  **Context:** A cold front moved through southern/western Ohio producing locally heavy rainfall.  \n\n- **Flood** — **Mar 14, 2007 (6:45 AM) to Mar 14, 2007 (9:30 AM)**  \n  **Damage:** ~$3,000 property; $0 crop  \n  **Details:** Several roads were flooded across the county.  \n  **Context:** Heavy rain ahead of a cold front affected west central/central Ohio and the Miami Valley.  \n\nIf you tell me a **date range** (e.g., “last 10 years”) or whether you want **all event types** (tornado, hail, wind, etc.), I can pull a broader history.",
